      "settings": {
        "liquid": "<style>\n  .wvv-section * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\n  .wvv-section {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 88px 24px;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"SF Pro Display\", \"Segoe UI\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .wvv-title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    color: #1d1d1f;\n    margin-bottom: 48px;\n  }\n\n  .wvv-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 18px;\n    max-width: 1160px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .wvv-card {\n    background: #f5f5f7;\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    padding: 32px 24px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .wvv-card-icon {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    background: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 0 auto 16px;\n    color: #0071e3;\n  }\n\n  .wvv-card-icon svg {\n    width: 21px;\n    height: 21px;\n  }\n\n  .wvv-card-label {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1d1d1f;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    letter-spacing: -0.005em;\n  }\n\n  .wvv-card-desc {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #6e6e73;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .wvv-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .wvv-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"wvv-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"wvv-title\">Pourquoi choisir la gamme Vigilia ?</h2>\n  <div class=\"wvv-grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"wvv-card\">\n      <div class=\"wvv-card-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"10\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"15\" r=\"1.2\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"></circle></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-label\">Simplicité d'utilisation</p>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-desc\">Une interface claire pour piloter votre système sans prise de tête.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wvv-card\">\n      <div class=\"wvv-card-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"7\" y=\"2\" width=\"10\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\"></rect><line x1=\"9.5\" y1=\"17.5\" x2=\"14.5\" y2=\"17.5\"></line></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-label\">App Daewoo Home Connect</p>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-desc\">Gérez votre système à distance, recevez des alertes et consultez vos caméras.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wvv-card\">\n      <div class=\"wvv-card-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"6\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2.5\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"10.5\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"10.5\"></line></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-label\">Sans abonnement</p>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-desc\">Vous payez le matériel, rien de plus.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wvv-card\">\n      <div class=\"wvv-card-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7v5l3 2\"></path></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-label\">Installation simple</p>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-desc\">Une prise secteur, une connexion Wi-Fi 2.4 GHz, et votre alarme est opérationnelle.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wvv-card\">\n      <div class=\"wvv-card-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"10.5\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"13.5\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-label\">Batterie de secours intégrée</p>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-desc\">Votre système reste actif même en cas de coupure de courant.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wvv-card\">\n      <div class=\"wvv-card-icon\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0-1.4 0l-6 6a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l3 3a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l6-6a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.4l-3-3z\"></path><path d=\"M9 8l7 7\"></path><path d=\"M5 20l3-1 8-8\"></path></svg>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-label\">Système évolutif</p>\n      <p class=\"wvv-card-desc\">Jusqu'à 90 accessoires compatibles selon vos besoins.</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
